## So are we secretly doing Wirtinger?

No — because your parameters are real.

If parameters were complex, then yes, you’d need proper Wirtinger handling.

Right now:

* Complex numbers exist in the forward pass
* But optimization lives in ( \mathbb{R}^n )

So everything is consistent.

